<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on SBC.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on SBC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG said on Wednesday it has issued three million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Swiss Bank Corp.</p>
<p>Five warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    260 CHF		   PREMIUM	10.49 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.70 CHF		  GEARING	13.66 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.JAN.97-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	22.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  252 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
